/**
 * Image studio bundle, node half.
 *
 * Two browser surfaces over one self-contained image service:
 *
 *  - a gallery of everything this panel has generated, kept in the harness
 *    cache directory, and
 *  - a generation studio with three modes: text-to-image and image-to-image
 *    call an image API directly, configured from the panel itself (provider,
 *    base URL, model, credential reference); the third runs a workflow on a
 *    ComfyUI server the user runs locally, talking HTTP straight to it.
 *
 * For the image-service modes the host half resolves the credential and speaks
 * the provider's own HTTP contract. For the ComfyUI mode the host reads the
 * workflow library from ComfyUI's own user-data directory, queues the prompt
 * there and copies the produced images into the panel's gallery — the project
 * Agent is not involved at all, and the browser never holds a provider secret.
 */

